<%#
  The feedback link. Sits at the bottom of the browse screens (dates, clubs,
  slots, the directory) and hands the person off to the bot chat, where any
  non-command message is forwarded to the owner. See ADR-0002.

  `label` is set by the caller: the copy is per-screen so a person on
  Slots sees the invitation their frustration matches.
%>
<div class="feedback">
  <a class="feedback__pill" data-tg-link href="<%= feedback_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <%= label %>
  </a>
</div>
